					"content": "有了这些铁球，一定会有很多人来的。阿响一定会高兴的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7221503,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7221503
